::U2UA_L5_Q01::FITT stands for {=Frequency, Intensity, Time, and Type~Fitness, Interval, Training, and Testing~Force, Intensity, Tempo, and Technique~Frequency, Improvement, Time, and Training}

::U2UA_L5_Q02::Frequency asks {=How often?~How hard?~How long?~What activity?}

::U2UA_L5_Q03::Intensity asks {=How hard?~How often?~How long?~What activity?}

::U2UA_L5_Q04::Time asks {=How long?~How hard?~How often?~What equipment?}

::U2UA_L5_Q05::Type asks {=What activity?~How often?~How long?~How much recovery?}

::U2UA_L5_Q06::Overload means {=an appropriate challenge beyond the current usual demand~maximum effort every session~pain during training~changing every variable at once}


